      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inverness%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By 1854 rail service reached Deer Grove, later joining the Chicago and North Western Railway.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
